---
import '@fontsource-variable/archivo/wdth.css'; import '@fontsource/dm-mono/400.css'; import SecondaryMasthead from '../../components/SecondaryMasthead.astro'; import { emailHref } from '../../data/site-links';
import { siteUrl } from '../../data/seo';
const title='Field approach | Dave Bettner';
const description =
  "Dave Bettner's field approach: how he would start with a new customer, from choosing the first problem through making the next deployment easier.";
const canonical = `${siteUrl}/fit/`;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
  <meta name="description" content={description}/>
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#08090b"/>
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"/>
  <link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/interstellar-system.css"/>
  <title>{title}</title>
</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><SecondaryMasthead context="Field approach"/><main id="main"><section class="field-plan"><div class="wrap"><h1>How I would start with a new customer.</h1><p class="lead">First I would learn the product and watch the customer’s current process. Then I would pick one workflow we can measure and own it through deployment. What fails along the way should turn into product feedback, tests, or better tools.</p><ol>{[['Weeks 1–2','Choose the first problem.','Learn the product and watch the customer’s current process. Find the part that costs time or creates risk. Before moving on, agree on an owner, a measure of success, and what we will not solve yet.'],['Weeks 3–6','Build one path end to end.','Build one working integration with the customer, product, and engineering teams. Instrument it, test how it fails, and decide what has to be fixed before launch.'],['Weeks 6–10','Learn from the breakage.','When it breaks, separate configuration problems from product gaps and infrastructure failures. Explain the customer impact, then fix it, narrow the scope, or stop.'],['Weeks 10–13','Make the next one easier.','Turn the hard parts into tests, telemetry, tools, or a short runbook. Product and engineering should leave with a clear list of recurring gaps and the customer context behind them.']].map((step,index)=><li><span class="step-meta"><b>{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</b>{step[0]}</span><div><h2>{step[1]}</h2><p>{step[2]}</p></div></li>)}</ol><nav class="page-links"><a href="/work/">Work</a><a href="/experience/">Experience</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href={emailHref}>Contact</a></nav></div></section></main><script is:inline type="module" src="/interstellar.js"></script></body></html>
<style is:global>
.field-plan{background:#0d1013;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding:clamp(52px,9vw,120px) 0}.field-plan .wrap{max-width:900px}.eyebrow{color:var(--orange)}h1{max-width:18ch;margin:14px 0;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,5rem)}.lead{max-width:65ch;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6}.field-plan ol{list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:60px}.field-plan li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:28px;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.step-meta{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:500 .72rem/1.4 'DM Mono',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}.step-meta b{display:block;color:var(--orange);font:650 2.35rem/1 'Archivo Variable',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-bottom:8px}.field-plan h2{font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:8px}.field-plan p{color:var(--muted);max-width:58ch}.page-links{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px}.page-links a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}footer{padding:28px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}@media(max-width:600px){.wrap{width:calc(100% - 28px)}.field-plan li{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}}
</style>